      "id": "cjc-1295-no-dac",
      "name": "CJC-1295 (no DAC)",
      "aliases": [],
      "kind": "product",
      "identityStatus": "needs_confirmation",
      "categoryID": 4,
      "benefits": "Proposed growth-hormone benefits: short-acting GHRH-like stimulation is intended to support brief endogenous GH pulses and downstream IGF-1 signaling. Proposed goals include fat loss, lean-muscle recovery, tissue repair, deeper sleep and skin elasticity. Direct clinical benefits of the no-DAC compound were not established in the sources reviewed; DAC studies do not validate no-DAC claims. Greater safety or lower pituitary desensitization than the DAC version has not been established."
    }
  ],
