      "locator": "Benefits research; see cited study/label",
      "evidenceNote": "Distinct active moieties; no human efficacy evidence identified for no-DAC, pp.6,49–50. Category rationale: Growth Hormone is an intended-use classification for this GHRH analogue, not a finding of demonstrated benefit.\nOwner follow-up 2026-10-15: FDA separates DAC and no-DAC active moieties; human clinical studies apparently used DAC. Supports the limits on transferring hormone, clinical efficacy or safety findings to no-DAC. The listed wellness benefits are owner-supplied proposed goals, not verified clinical outcomes. Category rationale: The proposed benefits center on the GH/IGF-1 pathway.",
